# Tourist journey after search: trip request -> negotiate -> book -> pay -> review.
# Use a TOURIST token in .env (YOCABS_TOKEN) unless a request says PARTNER.

@base = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@tripRequestId = PASTE_TRIP_REQUEST_ID
@vehicleId = PASTE_VEHICLE_ID
@negotiationId = PASTE_NEGOTIATION_ID
@bookingId = PASTE_BOOKING_ID
@paymentId = PASTE_PAYMENT_ID

### 1. Create a trip request (the tourist is taken from the token, never from the body)
POST {{base}}/trip-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv YOCABS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pickupDescription": "Bhubaneswar Airport",
  "pickupLatitude": 20.2444,
  "pickupLongitude": 85.8178,
  "stops": [],
  "destinationDescription": "Puri",
  "destinationLatitude": 19.8135,
  "destinationLongitude": 85.8312,
  "startDate": "2026-10-10",
  "endDate": "2026-10-10",
  "passengerCount": 4,
  "tripBrief": "Airport to Puri",
  "vehicleCategory": "SUV"
}

### 2. Submit it
POST {{base}}/trip-requests/{{tripRequestId}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv YOCABS_TOKEN}}

### 3. Ask for a better price (one offer per partner per trip)
POST {{base}}/trip-requests/{{tripRequestId}}/negotiations
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv YOCABS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": "{{vehicleId}}",
  "tripType": "CHAUFFEUR_ONE_WAY",
  "offeredAmount": 1800.00
}

### 3a. PARTNER responds: ACCEPT | REJECT | COUNTER (needs a PARTNER token)
POST {{base}}/negotiations/{{negotiationId}}/respond
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv YOCABS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "COUNTER",
  "counterAmount": 1950.00
}

### 3b. Tourist accepts or declines the counter offer
POST {{base}}/negotiations/{{negotiationId}}/counter-response
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv YOCABS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accept": true
}

### 4. Book (price, availability and eligibility are re-checked; the Idempotency-Key makes retries safe)
POST {{base}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv YOCABS_TOKEN}}
Idempotency-Key: 7f3c0d9e-2b7a-4c55-9f0e-6f1d2a3b4c5d
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tripRequestId": "{{tripRequestId}}",
  "vehicleId": "{{vehicleId}}",
  "tripType": "CHAUFFEUR_ONE_WAY",
  "negotiationId": "{{negotiationId}}"
}

### 5. Start the 5% token payment
POST {{base}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv YOCABS_TOKEN}}

### 5a. DEV ONLY: play the payment provider and complete the payment (outcome SUCCESS | FAILURE)
POST {{base}}/dev/payments/{{paymentId}}/simulate
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv YOCABS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "outcome": "SUCCESS"
}

### 6. My bookings
GET {{base}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv YOCABS_TOKEN}}

### 7. Cancel (refund follows the free-cancellation window)
POST {{base}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv YOCABS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Plans changed"
}

### 8. Review a completed trip
POST {{base}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv YOCABS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Smooth ride"
}

### 9. Notifications
GET {{base}}/notifications?unreadOnly=true
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv YOCABS_TOKEN}}
